OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine end
OL,6,Fto the day with some evening sunshine.
OL,7,FOvernight, areas of low cloud will
OL,8,Freform, giving some hill fog over
OL,9,Fwestern hills. The odd spot of drizzle
OL,10,Flater. Another warm night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA grey morning in the north
OL,13,Fand west with patchy drizzle. Warm
OL,14,Fsunny spells developing for the
OL,15,Fafternoon, especially in the south and
OL,16,Feast, staying cloudy in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
